sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Platform Admin
    participant Values as Helm Values<br/>(values.yaml)
    participant Helm as Helm Engine
    participant Kustomize as Kustomize Engine
    participant OLM as OLM<br/>(Operator Lifecycle Manager)
    participant Cluster as Target Cluster<br/>(OpenShift / XKS)
    participant Operators as Platform Operators<br/>(cert-manager, kueue, etc.)

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over Admin,Cluster: OpenShift Deployment Path (Helm + OLM)
        Admin->>Values: Configure profile (default/rhaii)<br/>Set component managementState overrides
        Values->>Helm: helm install rhai-on-openshift-chart
        Helm->>Cluster: Template & apply DSCInitialization CR
        Helm->>Cluster: Template & apply DataScienceCluster CR<br/>(KServe, Dashboard, Ray, Kueue, etc.)
        Helm->>Cluster: Template & apply KServe Inference Gateway<br/>(GatewayClass + Gateway)
        Helm->>Cluster: Template & apply MaaS Gateway<br/>(GatewayClass + Gateway)
        Helm->>Cluster: Template & apply Kuadrant CR<br/>(kuadrant-system namespace)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over Admin,Cluster: Kustomize Subscription Path (OpenShift)
        Admin->>Kustomize: kubectl apply -k dependencies/operators/
        Kustomize->>Cluster: Apply OLM Subscription manifests<br/>(cert-manager, kueue, jobset, observability,<br/>telemetry, tempo, RHCL, custom-metrics)
        Cluster->>OLM: Process Subscriptions
        OLM->>Operators: Install & manage operator lifecycle
        Admin->>Kustomize: kubectl apply -k configurations/
        Kustomize->>Cluster: Apply post-install configuration CRs<br/>(Kueue, JobSet, LeaderWorkerSet, Kuadrant)
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over Admin,Cluster: Non-OpenShift (XKS) Deployment Path
        Admin->>Values: Configure cloud-specific values<br/>(Azure, CoreWeave, AWS sections)
        Values->>Helm: helm install rhai-on-xks-chart<br/>(--set install-with-helm-dependencies)
        Helm->>Cluster: Install cert-manager (Helm sub-chart)
        Helm->>Cluster: Install gateway-api CRDs (Helm sub-chart)
        Helm->>Cluster: Install sail-operator (Helm sub-chart)
        Helm->>Cluster: Install rhcl-operator (Helm sub-chart)
        Helm->>Cluster: Install lws-operator (Helm sub-chart)
        Helm->>Cluster: Install rhai-operator (Helm sub-chart)
    end

    rect rgb(245, 230, 255)
        Note over Admin,Cluster: ArgoCD Path (Alternative)
        Admin->>Cluster: ArgoCD Application pointing to odh-gitops repo
        Cluster->>Helm: ArgoCD renders Helm chart
        Helm->>Cluster: Apply rendered manifests
    end
